            <lg xml:id="m-68011ad1-6787-4d40-93c2-b8efbd54ec76">
              <l xml:id="m-249592e5-aec1-4189-a126-518cf1619951" facs="#m-05202786-de1d-467f-b47f-e465ff29ed82" label="ambiguous">1364</l><l xml:id="m-3d40965a-ce41-42f9-9929-00f3a8dc5188" facs="#m-fff7bdf8-8b97-4403-bdf8-d429f03c95ba" label="ambiguous">February 2.</l><l xml:id="m-37663a2e-c5a2-4590-b97e-6bb585835600" facs="#m-ab1d330f-3863-484e-9944-df3c5d93d5a1" label="lyrics-like">in pá¬ ce. V. Qui- a vidérunt ócu-li mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-a40f7c7c-fae6-403e-bbd8-8f2ee31cc3ab" facs="#m-aee6ba25-2f55-422a-93fc-bca20e7ebef9" label="lyrics-like">V. Quod pa-rá¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf520011-a5c7-4412-94d4-28fd064e8092" facs="#m-a990d399-70f1-470d-9bbf-ad48de31e19b" label="lyrics-like">sa- lutá-re tú-um.</l><l xml:id="m-437649a5-7501-4387-acbb-e4a1978523c6" facs="#m-6abb7536-8233-4e10-a457-c6fbe2f43ad7" label="lyrics-like">sti ante fá¬ ci¬ em ómni-um populó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ab308ec-a60a-4690-88d0-e37606af74b6" facs="#m-64d5e7b1-dae8-4f29-a445-909ac098f71b" label="lyrics-like">rum. V. Lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-2d94483e-981b-47e6-a89d-69debd7f20f5" facs="#m-ca07d195-626c-4647-a406-06e634443fb1" label="lyrics-like">ad re-ve-lati-ónem</l><l xml:id="m-cd49af57-5564-420f-aecd-570a16f63f5c" facs="#m-2c9d46b3-ecfd-41cf-bd12-212fa2c0c8b1" label="ambiguous">men</l><l xml:id="m-604b84d9-06d9-4133-afab-08686abe867a" facs="#m-a479bf87-07c4-4e7b-962e-c9ef9684179b" label="lyrics-like">et gló-ri- am</l><l xml:id="m-430d0c71-9e46-4ef9-9f23-fd3da4bad88d" facs="#m-235e4ff6-3fcf-4585-a0c3-92803823df41" label="lyrics-like">plé¬ bis</l><l xml:id="m-9d384ffb-3d02-4022-a3cb-013ca0cb4d36" facs="#m-8834ed48-79ec-4297-96c0-cdc9943c1b48" label="lyrics-like">gén-ti-um,</l><l xml:id="m-9ba17fff-62ff-456f-9e06-b642399b17d7" facs="#m-6189727e-8a23-48b2-b67f-707f4ed4bbf6" label="lyrics-like">tú-ae" Isra-el.</l><l xml:id="m-9ea3febe-78f9-4a01-86ce-934fd2037a89" facs="#m-1e8c9624-2583-440a-a1ed-8c8aaff6a499" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 2. c.</l><l xml:id="m-62a20e09-e935-4e73-83a1-3c6be27e1dee" facs="#m-859fdcf5-6471-43df-8027-f60c63776368" label="lyrics-like">Nillo témpore: Postquam implé-ritu Sancto, non visúrum se mor¬</l><l xml:id="m-2c38d12f-ae75-42a1-b497-722c67dfe232" facs="#m-f284694a-d1c2-4769-bbe5-7431aa05f37c" label="lyrics-like">I ti sunt dies purgatiónis Mariae</l><l xml:id="m-24752700-3d81-4d0e-9640-be363583cb12" facs="#m-b8f06a97-acf8-4cb8-950a-d0b4e4190b96" label="lyrics-like">tem, nisi prius vidéret Christum</l><l xml:id="m-415ac185-0ae2-4a4c-b6f2-e22ad0a7e19c" facs="#m-4c921038-93ba-4f87-bb2f-c2f7b305a993" label="lyrics-like">secúndum legem Móysi, tulérunt</l><l xml:id="m-ca591092-f5bc-439c-9dc9-c2212a4ceaac" facs="#m-df944641-8b38-42ec-8f7d-6defd830bd4e" label="lyrics-like">Dómini. Et venit in spiritu in tem¬</l><l xml:id="m-cba5f8e3-9271-4999-b3ef-a6adc0dd0ef4" facs="#m-18c96db2-ea58-4e82-807f-6648712206ca" label="lyrics-like">Jesum in Jerúsalem, ut sisterent</l><l xml:id="m-942950db-faf2-4901-87da-300bb40c1013" facs="#m-de3ec820-7a76-4aa1-a250-8e4f171f98cc" label="lyrics-like">plum. Et cum indúcerent púerum</l><l xml:id="m-a3e38b0a-8990-44d9-9a4b-2a56a9ea4555" facs="#m-5a7d4709-fcd0-44cb-963c-4071ba5b5de5" label="lyrics-like">eum Dómino, sicut scriptum est in</l><l xml:id="m-cf2175ca-ce46-4ce6-a0f2-7ffd957357a1" facs="#m-5263f673-8f53-4486-9325-2f63cda62044" label="lyrics-like">Jesum paréntes ejus, ut fácerent</l><l xml:id="m-694fc326-2426-4db7-8492-57ef10ce34b9" facs="#m-4c9a8adc-2c4c-4f75-a229-3517abd8596c" label="lyrics-like">lege Dómini: Quia omne mascu¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd7c7acd-6afb-4226-9752-f7cb42c60c22" facs="#m-e799a1e4-b93d-4385-93e2-e6241f01a60e" label="lyrics-like">secúndum consuetúdinem legis pro</l><l xml:id="m-720d8f5c-1fd8-4c0f-a3ae-a317498b7054" facs="#m-45d11f27-51c9-4370-b6d7-84361df04563" label="lyrics-like">e: et ipse accépit eum in ulnas</l><l xml:id="m-bcabd0c4-5440-4bd6-99cf-96b87aee5b83" facs="#m-eb9dc11f-d17e-4de7-9135-1b0b72b3d569" label="lyrics-like">linum adapériens vulvam, sanctum</l><l xml:id="m-ab2d3ab3-f4c7-496e-b129-b82f15e86e30" facs="#m-98c26136-8852-4904-be3c-153bffba8f07" label="lyrics-like">Dómino vocábitur. Et ut darent</l><l xml:id="m-ae3ec2a7-4ff5-4392-977d-e660b38bf164" facs="#m-020b2f63-d68f-45a7-977f-637e5bb20885" label="ambiguous">suas, et benedixit Deum, et dixit:</l><l xml:id="m-b4157026-6d32-4a14-9682-ccc55b06d5d6" facs="#m-3bf87b57-36b2-4010-ba77-92be2b5e218b" label="lyrics-like">Nunc dimittis servum tuum Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-6eaedfe0-c92d-4c91-a114-7f5aa80353c7" facs="#m-ba4654e5-fa69-4327-8803-59124aad24cc" label="lyrics-like">hóstiam secúndum quod dictum est</l><l xml:id="m-571ac129-48ca-427b-a07c-b3eeb3519efa" facs="#m-31503e82-a8ed-4447-a3d1-21a8f7a65730" label="lyrics-like">in lege Dómini, par túrturum, aut</l><l xml:id="m-4aefc960-b774-4763-918b-15a202d3db98" facs="#m-4dad7f44-1a5d-421f-9b55-2b63a6b01b43" label="lyrics-like">secúndum verbum tuum in pace:</l><l xml:id="m-b25f40cb-5b2e-4709-b4f9-060e6ce4eba6" facs="#m-f290a027-7167-4e49-841a-2cea9a9119af" label="lyrics-like">duos pullos columbárum. Et ecce</l><l xml:id="m-12e8aef0-543e-41a4-a3e1-d21c414a240b" facs="#m-1c19c777-a27d-4a68-893b-04f6fc1ceb08" label="lyrics-like">quia vidérunt óculi mei salutáre</l><l xml:id="m-58865e5a-ca07-4601-8720-4cfa933d47ae" facs="#m-4e087205-a05e-4dc3-93fa-bfe2b501632a" label="lyrics-like">homo erat in Jerúsalem, cui nomen</l><l xml:id="m-91de71f7-6a6f-4f0e-9a3a-33f71186a66c" facs="#m-9dbce004-4888-483a-a79a-206b937d83d9" label="lyrics-like">tuum: quod parásti ante fáciem</l><l xml:id="m-20dde702-32cb-4180-bce7-2de87934a288" facs="#m-7e80564f-0d75-45b4-93b2-9dbcd29db676" label="lyrics-like">Símeon, et homo iste justus et timo¬</l><l xml:id="m-08433803-f5c6-467b-8177-79b9dfa5fc35" facs="#m-cc25ab83-a3c4-4ba7-8dd1-b398d039cf24" label="lyrics-like">ómnium populórum: lumen ad</l><l xml:id="m-f33aabd0-aecc-4eed-b81f-45f2b493037a" facs="#m-aaf2cc80-ed69-4450-a789-00b652b87505" label="lyrics-like">rátus, exspéctans consolatiónem</l><l xml:id="m-24f750c6-558d-426a-a094-53c2db0f4329" facs="#m-0cc7f17b-84f3-4b11-8509-be795eaea8a2" label="lyrics-like">revelatiónem géntium, et glóriam</l><l xml:id="m-5189df86-28ff-4ead-b690-29d9205fe5c1" facs="#m-ea001c7b-8a64-4426-9e8c-77c38cbacb21" label="ambiguous">Israel, et Spiritus Sanctus erat in</l><l xml:id="m-f67e26a9-704e-470d-a27d-11c6cef5cb0f" facs="#m-e91518ac-1f55-450d-a26c-2f65f8c8e69a" label="ambiguous">plebis tuae Israel.</l><l xml:id="m-86dff503-50c4-43e6-be4e-bd8e4ac4a896" facs="#m-d5eb68bf-1845-400d-a0f3-7b48c3544961" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-0afbd2af-86c5-46f3-b198-4969db9d7f42" facs="#m-7a009aeb-5c70-4631-8fa0-f7522fc83682" label="lyrics-like">eo. Et respónsum accéperat a Spi¬</l><l xml:id="m-4997eefa-aca7-4e1c-ba56-ba46ce720e40" facs="#m-bd0a7726-6489-4297-bf11-6723d34a2447" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Diffúsa est. p. 1223.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>